        "text_n8T7fN": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "enlarge_text": true,
            "text": "<p><strong>Rebel Nell One-Year Jewelry Warranty</strong><br/>Every Rebel Nell piece is handmade in Detroit from meaningful, repurposed materials—each one-of-a-kind, each telling a story. We stand behind our craftsmanship and offer a <strong>one-year jewelry warranty</strong> to make sure your piece meets our high standards.</p><p>If your Rebel Nell jewelry arrives damaged or has a defect from our making, we’ll repair or replace it at no cost within one year of purchase.</p><p><strong>What’s covered:</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Rings</strong> – If the band breaks within one year, we’ll replace the full ring.<br/></li><li><strong>Necklaces & Bracelets</strong> – If a clasp breaks within one year, we’ll replace the entire piece.<br/></li><li><strong>Earrings</strong> – Huggie styles (like Rosie or Jasmine) can’t be repaired, but we’ll replace your pair within one year.<br/></li><li><strong>Accessories & Men’s Accessories</strong> – Keychains, bottle stoppers, coasters, drink picks, cufflinks, etc.—our production team will review and repair or replace when possible.<br/></li></ul><p><strong>What’s not covered:</strong> Normal wear and tear (tarnishing, scratches), accidental damage, improper use, or any third-party alterations.</p><p>Questions? Contact us at <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>rebelnell@rebelnell.com </strong></span>and we’ll help keep your Rebel Nell jewelry looking its best.</p>"
          }
        }
